# Saxane Real Estate Management System

# ─── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The real environment file never enters the repository. .env.example is the
# committed template and is explicitly re-included below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Logs & runtime ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
error_log
php_errorlog

# ─── OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# ─── Editors ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ─── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Not used today (there is no composer.json), listed so a future `composer
# require` does not commit a vendor tree by accident.
/vendor/
/node_modules/
